      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782372637986,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Identification:\n   Write the problem\n   in detail.\n\n2. Incubation:\n   Step away 1-4 hrs,\n   light activity.\n\n3. Free Writing:\n   Let answers trickle out.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Identification:\n   Write the problem\n   in detail.\n\n2. Incubation:\n   Step away 1-4 hrs,\n   light activity.\n\n3. Free Writing:\n   Let answers trickle out.",
